"68a548085165138168cd22bf","username":"radialycoris437","profilePicture":"/images/photo/68a548085165138168cd22bf-1769143097827.jpg","status":"offline","id":"68a548085165138168cd22bf"},"text":"Could you please take a very close look at your avatar-copying script and fix it? There are quite a few bugs in it, so please test(in game) it carefully before uploading."},"edited":false,"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-10-17T19:42:56.233Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6ad3de35d15ace87ad3210cd","commentBy":{"_id":"68a548085165138168cd22bf","username":"radialycoris437","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6a2ba7de324de8de76b8068b396853c473eff9a5c2b5de9444032cd2bab9c784.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68a548085165138168cd22bf-1769143097827.jpg"},"createdAt":"2025-08-20T03:59:04.744Z","lastActive":"2026-10-22T06:47:25.494Z","lvl":6,"status":"offline","id":"68a548085165138168cd22bf","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6a2ba7de324de8de76b8068b396853c473eff9a5c2b5de9444032cd2bab9c784.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68a548085165138168cd22bf-1769143097827.jpg"}},"text":"Hi @mbg34, here is a detailed breakdown of the bugs I found while testing (especially in v1 / transplant mode):\n1. R6 Old Face Overlapping: When copying a new R6 avatar, the old face decal on the head isn't cleared, causing it to overlap with the new face.\n2. UI Corner Radius Missing: Some sub-containers and internal frames inside tabs lack UICorner objects, leaving sharp 90-degree corners.\n3. 3D Preview Glitch (R15): Opening the 3D Preview when the local character is R15 causes model/CFrame distortion.\n4. R15 Scaling Error: Body scale values don't apply correctly when copying while in R15, leading to distorted proportions.\n5. Instant Character Death (R15): Copying while in R15 causes the local character to instantly die (Health = 0) due to replacePart() breaking Motor6D joints on the torso.\n6. ForceField Detachment (R15): The default Roblox spawn ForceField unwelds and drops to the ground upon resetting or joining in R15.\n7. Tool Grip Misalignment (R15): Held items/tools become offset or misaligned because RightGrip CFrames don't adjust to the target's R15 hand scaling.\n8. Other Unidentified Bugs: There are still a few other undiscovered issues/edge cases that haven't been fully tracked down yet.\n9. Anti-Cheat Detection: The script methods trigger anti-cheat systems in certain games, resulting in bans or kicks.\nHope this helps you debug the script before the update! Thanks for your hard work!","parent":{"_id":"6ad3cfc0e8387783291c823d","commentBy":{"_id":"6a4e43024dc035dbde8131c7","username":"mbg34","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"6a4e43024dc035dbde8131c7"},"text":"@radialycoris437 what kind of mistakes for example"},"edited":true,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-10-17T20:44:37.366Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6ad3e2c5a2bd3672cef2661a","commentBy":{"_id":"6a4e43024dc035dbde8131c7","username":"mbg34","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lastActive":"2026-10-22T18:04:16.263Z","createdAt":"2026-07-08T12:30:58.824Z","lvl":5,"status":"offline","id":"6a4e43024dc035dbde8131c7","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"@radialycoris437 OK, I'll fix everything I can.","parent":{"_id":"6ad3de35d15ace87ad3210cd","commentBy":{"_id":"68a548085165138168cd22bf","username":"radialycoris437","profilePicture":"/images/photo/68a548085165138168cd22bf-1769143097827.jpg","status":"offline","id":"68a548085165138168cd22bf"},"text":"Hi @mbg34, here is a detailed breakdown of the bugs I found while testing (especially in v1 / transplant mode):\n1. R6 Old Face Overlapping: When copying a new R6 avatar, the old face decal on the head isn't cleared, causing it to overlap with the new face.\n2. UI Corner Radius Missing: Some sub-containers and internal frames inside tabs lack UICorner objects, leaving sharp 90-degree corners.\n3. 3D Preview Glitch (R15): Opening the 3D Preview when the local character is R15 causes model/CFrame distortion.\n4. R15 Scaling Error: Body scale values don't apply correctly when copying while in R15, leading to distorted proportions.\n5. Instant Character Death (R15): Copying while in R15 causes the local character to instantly die (Health = 0) due to replacePart() breaking Motor6D joints on the torso.\n6. ForceField Detachment (R15): The default Roblox spawn ForceField unwelds and drops to the ground upon resetting or joining in R15.\n7. Tool Grip Misalignment (R15): Held items/tools become offset or misaligned because RightGrip CFrames don't adjust to the target's R15 hand scaling.\n8. Other Unidentified Bugs: There are still a few other undiscovered issues/edge cases that haven't been fully tracked down yet.\n9. Anti-Cheat Detection: The script methods trigger anti-cheat systems in certain games, resulting in bans or kicks.\nHope this helps you debug the script before the update! Thanks for your hard work!"},"edited":false,"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-10-17T21:04:05.995Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6ad4140cc13049f4635c1ac3","commentBy":{"_id":"6a4e43024dc035dbde8131c7","username":"mbg34","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lastActive":"2026-10-22T18:04:16.263Z","createdAt":"2026-07-08T12:30:58.824Z","lvl":5,"status":"offline","id":"6a4e43024dc035dbde8131c7","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"Upd \nAdded Roblox Shop (currently buggy).\nFixed some bugs (possibly).","edited":true,"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-10-18T00:34:20.490Z","liked":fa